    {
      "id": "ref-01",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/01_马尾_直顺马尾.jpg",
      "x": -2920,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-01",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 01｜直顺马尾\n\n**家族：** 马尾\n\n单束低中位马尾，主体直顺垂落。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Indian_woman_in_ponytail.jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -2920,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-02",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/02_马尾_发束包裹马尾.jpg",
      "x": -2340,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 02｜发束包裹马尾\n\n**家族：** 马尾\n\n发束包覆主束点，隐藏发圈并强化束点。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hair_Wrapped_Ponytail.JPG)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -2340,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-03",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/03_马尾_分节马尾.jpg",
      "x": -1760,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 03｜分节马尾\n\n**家族：** 马尾\n\n尾部由多个束点分节，形成泡泡式节奏。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sectioned_Ponytail.JPG)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -1760,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-04",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/04_短发_精灵短发.jpg",
      "x": -870,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-04",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 04｜精灵短发\n\n**家族：** 短发\n\n耳侧与后颈显著缩短，顶部保留短层。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.allure.com/story/pixie-haircut)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -870,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-05",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/05_短发_渐层Bob.jpg",
      "x": -290,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-05",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 05｜渐层Bob\n\n**家族：** 短发\n\n后短前长，后脑堆叠形成斜向重量线。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.elle.com/beauty/hair/a65352286/graduated-bob-hairstyles/)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -290,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-06",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/06_短发_齐切Bob.jpg",
      "x": 290,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-06",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 06｜齐切Bob\n\n**家族：** 短发\n\n下缘近水平齐切，重量线完整。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_with_bob_haircut.jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 290,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-07",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/07_卷发_中长卷发.jpg",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-07",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 07｜中长卷发\n\n**家族：** 卷发\n\n中等卷径沿中长发重复形成C弯与S波。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Woman_with_curly_brown_hairstyle.jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-08",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/08_卷发_Afro圆形自然卷.jpg",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-08",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 08｜Afro圆形自然卷\n\n**家族：** 卷发\n\n紧密自然卷向四周扩张，形成圆形大体量。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Natural_redhead_black_girl_(red_power_hairstyle).jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-09",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/09_卷发_蓬松卷发.jpg",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-09",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 09｜蓬松卷发\n\n**家族：** 卷发\n\n高蓬松量与重复卷组并存。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voluminous_curly_hairstyle.jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-10",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/10_公主切_经典中分公主切.jpg",
      "x": -2920,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 10｜经典中分公主切\n\n**家族：** 公主切\n\n中分额面与下颌平切侧片并存。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.meifazhan.com/lxfx/liuhai/186605.html)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -2920,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-11",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/11_公主切_棕色柔化公主切.jpg",
      "x": -2340,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 11｜棕色柔化公主切\n\n**家族：** 公主切\n\n硬切侧片被薄刘海与棕色长发柔化。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.meifazhan.com/lxfx/liuhai/186605.html)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -2340,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-12",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/12_公主切_齐刘海长发公主切.jpg",
      "x": -1760,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 12｜齐刘海长发公主切\n\n**家族：** 公主切\n\n齐刘海、脸侧短片、胸下长发三层清楚。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.meifazhan.com/lxfx/liuhai/186605.html)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -1760,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-13",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/13_双马尾_低双马尾.jpg",
      "x": -870,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 13｜低双马尾\n\n**家族：** 双马尾\n\n左右两个低位束点，尾部自然垂落。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Smiling_woman_with_pigtails.JPG)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -870,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-14",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/14_双马尾_贴头双辫.jpg",
      "x": -290,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-14",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 14｜贴头双辫\n\n**家族：** 双马尾\n\n左右双轨贴头编织，作为双束编发子型。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.allure.com/gallery/box-braids-hair-inspiration)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": -290,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-15",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/15_双马尾_长双马尾.jpg",
      "x": 290,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 15｜长双马尾\n\n**家族：** 双马尾\n\n左右高位长束点，长尾向两侧垂落。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_girl_with_twin_tails;_January_2016_(04).jpg)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 290,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-16",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/16_狼尾_Mixie短狼尾.jpg",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-16",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 16｜Mixie短狼尾\n\n**家族：** 狼尾\n\n耳侧短层与后颈长尾并置。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.allure.com/story/mixie-mullet-pixie-haircut-trend)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-17",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/17_狼尾_顺直长层轻狼尾.jpg",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-17",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 17｜顺直长层轻狼尾\n\n**家族：** 狼尾\n\n长直主体中加入轻碎层和柔和尾部。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://thebeautyfoodie.com/korean-wolf-cut/)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-18",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch01_r2/selected/18_狼尾_长款Hush轻狼尾.jpg",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "card-18",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 18｜长款Hush轻狼尾\n\n**家族：** 狼尾\n\n羽毛脸周层、轻冠部体量与细长发尾并存。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.mujerhoy.com/belleza/pelo/corte-hush-cut-tendencia-pelo-otono-2023-20230923114458-nt.html)\n\n**证据状态：** `image-present / source-confirmed / audit-pending`",
